@startuml
title Hydrated Edit -> Existing Local Change / Upload Path
actor User
participant Application as App
participant FUSE as Fuse
folder "Physical sync_dir" as Disk
participant "Existing inotify /\nlocal reconciliation" as Local
participant "Existing sync engine" as Sync
cloud "Microsoft Graph" as Graph
database "Item DB" as DB

User -> App : edit / save hydrated file
App -> Fuse : write / rename / replace / close
Fuse -> Disk : operate on physical backing content
Disk -> Local : filesystem event(s)
Local -> Sync : existing local change processing
Sync -> Graph : existing upload / rename / delete
Graph --> Sync : remote result
Sync -> DB : existing metadata update
note over Fuse,Local
Architectural target: no special FUSE upload engine.
This path must be proven by prototype testing,
including editor atomic-save behaviour.
end note
@enduml
